  "Id": 1122,
  "Title": "\u200bAKU hosts first eyer Inter Medical College Cricket Tournament",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "\u200bThe Aga Khan University had organized an Inter Medical College Cricket Tournament for which the final was played on June 1; 2000.This was the first such Tournament amongst medical institutions. Teams from six medical colleges had participated.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClassD6C7607E469241239F6B62D3DBC84BB6\"><div>\u200bThe Aga Khan University had organized an Inter Medical College Cricket Tournament for which the final was played on June 1; 2000.This was the first such Tournament amongst medical institutions. Teams from six medical colleges had participated. These included Baqai Medical College, Dow Medical College, Hamdard Medical College, Jinnah Medical College, Ziauddin Medical College and The Aga Khan University (AKU) Medical College.</div><div><br></div><div>Following are the results for the Final played between Baqai Medical College and Dow Medical College, at the AKU Sports and Rehabilitation Center Cricket Ground.&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>Toss won by Baqai Medical College, who elected to bat first.&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>Baqai Batting&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>Fahad&#160;</div><div>Shahzad&#160;</div><div>Baber</div><div><br></div><div>47 run&#160;</div><div>45 runs&#160;</div><div>41 runs&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>DMC Bowling&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>Raheel&#160;</div><div>Faizan</div><div><br></div><div>3 for 26 in 5 overs&#160;</div><div>2 for 43 in 5 overs&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>Total&#58; Baqai 194 runs for 7 wickets in 25 overs.&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>DMC Batting&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>Faizan&#160;</div><div>Raheel&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>35 runs&#160;</div><div>33 runs&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>Baqai Bowling&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>Ain ul Haq&#160;</div><div>Fahad</div><div>&#160;</div><div>4 for 15 in 5 overs</div><div>2 for 28 in 5 overs</div><div><br></div><div>Total&#58; DMC all out for 133 runs in 20.1 overs&#160;</div><div>Man of the Match&#58; Baber&#160;</div><div>Baqai Medical College won the match</div></div>",
